ed QC with `robot verify` for:\n+  - `qc-proxy-merge-missing-preferred.sparql`\n+  - `qc-misused-replaced-by.sparql`\n+  - `qc-obsoletion-reason.sparql`\n+  - `qc-deprecated-class-reference.sparql`\n+  - `qc-xref-without-precision.sparql`\n+  - `qc-duplicate-exact-synonym-no-abbrev.sparql`\n+- All targeted QC queries passed with 0 violations.\n+\n+Checklist completed:\n+- [x] Read issue context and identified requested replacement target.\n+- [x] Inspected both MONDO term stanzas before editing.\n+- [x] Applied obsoletion-with-replacement using the checkout/checkin workflow.\n+- [x] Reduced the obsolete stanza to allowed obsoletion metadata.\n+- [x] Transferred retained synonym/xref/resource content to the surviving term.\n+- [x] Verified no remaining external references to the obsolete term.\n+- [x] Ran syntax and targeted QC validation.\n+\n+Environment note:\n+- I could not run `make NORM` through ODK because `docker` is unavailable in this execution environment. The edit still passed `robot convert` and the targeted merge-related QC checks locally.\n*** End Patch"},"output":"Success. Updated the following files:\nA ISSUE_COMMENTS.md\nA PR_COMMENTS.md","metadata":{"diff":"Index: /__w/eval-ont-agent-mondo/eval-ont-agent-mondo/ISSUE_COMMENTS.md\n===================================================================\n--- /__w/eval-ont-agent-mondo/eval-ont-agent-mondo/ISSUE_COMMENTS.md\n+++ /__w/eval-ont-agent-mondo/eval-ont-agent-mondo/ISSUE_COMMENTS.md\n@@ -0,0 +1,3 @@\n+Addressed in PR #<NN>.\n+\n+`MONDO:0008549` has been obsoleted and replaced by `MONDO:0979242` to reflect the OMIM move from `187750` to `621260`.\n\nIndex: /__w/eval-ont-agent-mondo/eval-ont-agent-mondo/PR_COMMENTS.md\n===================================================================\n--- /__w/eval-ont-agent-mondo/eval-ont-agent-mondo/PR_COMMENTS.md\n+++ /__w/eval-ont-agent-mondo/eval-ont-agent-mondo/PR_COMMENTS.md\n@@ -0,0 +1,40 @@\n+Implemented the requested merge-style obsoletion for issue #9826